stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PlanCheap
  PlanCheap --> Retrieve
  Retrieve --> VerifyAndClose
  VerifyAndClose --> AtomicJudgment
  AtomicJudgment --> ExistingResolver
  ExistingResolver --> QualifiedOrReviewed: sufficient semantic evidence
  ExistingResolver --> StopRejected: rejection or structural impossibility
  ExistingResolver --> CheckBudgetAndNovelty: INSUFFICIENT / RETRIEVE_MORE_EVIDENCE
  CheckBudgetAndNovelty --> PlanExpanded: new context and budget remain
  PlanExpanded --> Retrieve
  CheckBudgetAndNovelty --> StopUnresolved: saturation / budget / maximum rounds
  QualifiedOrReviewed --> ExistingMutationPipeline: independently authorized
  QualifiedOrReviewed --> StopForHumanReview: qualification absent
  ExistingMutationPipeline --> VersionedCommit
  VersionedCommit --> [*]
  StopRejected --> [*]
  StopUnresolved --> [*]
  StopForHumanReview --> [*]
